  {
   "id": "t1134530484",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 200.0,
   "y": 1060.0,
   "width": 1801.8,
   "height": 18.2,
   "strokeColor": "#9DC4E6",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "Esc = back one level, everywhere. In a text input it blurs first and keeps what was typed. In filter mode the first Esc leaves the editor and KEEPS the filter; the second clears it \u2014 and the footer says so at the moment it matters.",
   "originalText": "Esc = back one level, everywhere. In a text input it blurs first and keeps what was typed. In filter mode the first Esc leaves the editor and KEEPS the filter; the second clears it \u2014 and the footer says so at the moment it matters.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.3,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1106327517,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1688751954,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1717000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "t1329656355",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 200.0,
   "y": 1120.0,
   "width": 1443.0,
   "height": 18.2,
   "strokeColor": "#9DC4E6",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "q = quit, from anywhere, immediately. There is nothing to confirm: every mutation commits when it is made. A confirmation with nothing behind it teaches people to dismiss confirmations.",
   "originalText": "q = quit, from anywhere, immediately. There is nothing to confirm: every mutation commits when it is made. A confirmation with nothing behind it teaches people to dismiss confirmations.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.3,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 847246112,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 659453145,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1717000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "t483921566",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 200.0,
   "y": 1180.0,
   "width": 1365.0,
   "height": 18.2,
   "strokeColor": "#FFC861",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": ":  and  Ctrl-K  are RESERVED and UNBOUND in Phase 1, so the Phase 2 command palette can claim them without retraining anyone. Pressing either does nothing, and shows no error.",
   "originalText": ":  and  Ctrl-K  are RESERVED and UNBOUND in Phase 1, so the Phase 2 command palette can claim them without retraining anyone. Pressing either does nothing, and shows no error.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.3,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 145132927,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 490807628,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1717000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "t1504216469",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 200.0,
   "y": 1240.0,
   "width": 1575.6,
   "height": 18.2,
   "strokeColor": "#8FD0FF",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "Focus is carried by THREE channels and any two are enough: position (a \u258c marker in the left gutter), weight (bold), colour (amber). Under NO_COLOR the first two survive. The focus ring is never removed.",
   "originalText": "Focus is carried by THREE channels and any two are enough: position (a \u258c marker in the left gutter), weight (bold), colour (amber). Under NO_COLOR the first two survive. The focus ring is never removed.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.3,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
